  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Similar to how we have the Face Mirror and Personal Mirror that are attached to your HUD / face, could we have the option for the camera's viewfinder to potentially be displayed there too? \n\nWhen you record videos of yourself, it becomes a pain to have to keep grabbing for your camera to check if everything is in frame. If it could simply have the option to be visible to you at all times on the HUD, just like the personal mirrors, it would make recording video involving yourself much more intuitive. Currently I have to use XSOverlay to do this, so having this just be a standard feature would be very nice!",
